Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original, by jd-solanki:
- Only the priority view: the "Grouped by space" view, the sort menu popup and the
  `agents.sort` shared key are removed.
- All four priority sections (Needs you, Done, Working, Idle) always show, even empty.
- Sections start folded except the most urgent one with agents; each then folds on its own.
- Rows show the space's repo name and its owner's avatar from the `space.repos` and
  `space.avatars` shared keys written by the `spaces-avatars` mod, falling back to the
  space name and program icon.
- JSDoc types, checked against Herdr's herdr.d.ts and gpui-kit.d.ts.
